vintage":"legal"},"loyalty":null,"mana_cost":"{U}","name":"Unsummon","oracle_id":"837182db-1bf3-4a2c-bd01-1af9d9873561","oracle_text":"Return target creature to its owner's hand.","power":null,"produced_mana":[],"released_at":"2026-04-24","toughness":null,"type_line":"Instant"}],"fixture_kind":"public_exact-list_card_data","rulings":[{"comment":"If a replacement effect would try to replace a card that you can't draw, that effect can't apply.","oracle_id":"1463795b-ec0c-44d6-ae1a-55f78d9843ec","published_at":"2014-02-01","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"If you draw a card, and then Spirit of the Labyrinth enters the battlefield, you won't be able to draw more cards that turn.","oracle_id":"1463795b-ec0c-44d6-ae1a-55f78d9843ec","published_at":"2014-02-01","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"If you haven't drawn any cards in a turn, and a spell or ability would cause you to draw multiple cards, you'll just draw one card.","oracle_id":"1463795b-ec0c-44d6-ae1a-55f78d9843ec","published_at":"2014-02-01","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"You can draw a maximum of one card on each player's turn. Subsequent card draws are ignored.","oracle_id":"1463795b-ec0c-44d6-ae1a-55f78d9843ec","published_at":"2014-02-01","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"If an attacking creature loses haste, perhaps because Fervor leaves the battlefield after attackers have been declared, it won't be removed from combat.","oracle_id":"8e0cea9c-3110-4728-9378-76849e33bb90","published_at":"2012-07-01","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"Dredge can replace any card draw, not only the one during your draw step.","oracle_id":"ac8fba34-512c-4f24-999a-ab72f1ce4acb","published_at":"2024-01-12","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"If an effect puts a card into your hand without specifically using the word \"draw,\" you're not drawing a card. Dredge can't replace this event.","oracle_id":"ac8fba34-512c-4f24-999a-ab72f1ce4acb","published_at":"2024-01-12","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"If you're drawing multiple cards, each draw is performed one at a time. For example, if you're instructed to draw two cards and you replace the first draw with a dredge ability, another card with a dredge ability (including one that was milled by the first dredge ability) may be used to replace the second draw.","oracle_id":"ac8fba34-512c-4f24-999a-ab72f1ce4acb","published_at":"2024-01-12","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"Once you've announced that you're applying a card's dredge ability to replace a draw, players can't take any actions until you've put that card into your hand and milled cards.","oracle_id":"ac8fba34-512c-4f24-999a-ab72f1ce4acb","published_at":"2024-01-12","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"One card draw can't be replaced by multiple dredge abilities.","oracle_id":"ac8fba34-512c-4f24-999a-ab72f1ce4acb","published_at":"2024-01-12","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"You can't attempt to use a dredge ability if you don't have enough cards in your library.","oracle_id":"ac8fba34-512c-4f24-999a-ab72f1ce4acb","published_at":"2024-01-12","source":"wotc"}],"schema_version":1,"source":"Scryfall Oracle/rulings subset for offline tests"}
